WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:05.150
<b><i>Imperialist from Choshu, Himura Battosai.</i></b>

00:05.940 --> 00:09.480
<b><i>You worked for five years,
from age 14 to 19.</i></b>

00:09.480 --> 00:11.570
<b><i>You spent the first half
as a literal manslayer,</i></b>

00:11.570 --> 00:14.450
<b><i>a merciless assassin
squirming in the shadows.</i></b>

00:14.700 --> 00:17.870
<b><i>In the second half,
you were a commando swordsman</i></b>

00:17.870 --> 00:20.490
<b><i>protecting comrades
from the Shogunate's swordsmen.</i></b>

00:21.250 --> 00:25.370
<b><i>You're famous to this day
because of the second job.</i></b>

00:26.080 --> 00:27.080
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

00:27.500 --> 00:28.880
<b>I advise against it.</b>

00:29.380 --> 00:30.920
<b>If the real Battosai were to linger,</b>

00:30.920 --> 00:33.090
<b>it would make everything for naught,
that it will.</b>

00:33.090 --> 00:35.550
<b>I'm not saying I want the Battosai
to stay here with me.</b>

00:35.550 --> 00:37.220
<b>I want you, a rurouni, to be here—</b>

00:39.220 --> 00:41.930
<b>Fine! If you want to go, just go!</b>

00:42.640 --> 00:46.520
<b>But at the least,
you can tell me your name before you go!</b>

00:46.980 --> 00:51.360
<b>Or do you not even want
to tell me your true name?</b>

00:54.650 --> 00:55.530
<b>Kenshin.</b>

00:57.820 --> 00:59.030
<b>Kenshin Himura.</b>

01:00.160 --> 01:02.450
<b>That is my current name, that it is.</b>

01:03.450 --> 01:07.080
<b>As a rurouni, I don't know
when I will wander to the next place.</b>

01:07.580 --> 01:08.920
<b>But if that's fine with you...</b>

01:09.420 --> 01:12.170
<b>I will stay here for the time being,
that I will.</b>

01:21.140 --> 01:24.060
<b>Oro? This is a pleasant scent.</b>

01:24.390 --> 01:28.480
<b>Can you tell? I splurged and
bought slightly better tea leaves.</b>

01:28.480 --> 01:30.860
<b>Oh, you're right. This is really tasty.</b>

01:31.070 --> 01:34.320
<b>Missie, you really have a thing
for tasty stuff, huh?</b>

01:35.240 --> 01:37.200
<b>She just thinks with her stomach.</b>

01:37.200 --> 01:40.240
<b>Though, thanks to that,
I get to eat great food.</b>

01:40.240 --> 01:42.030
<b>If that's how you feel, appreciate it.</b>

01:42.830 --> 01:44.450
<b>I appreciate it, that I do.</b>

01:47.540 --> 01:51.210
<b>How many years has it been
since I last had tea this tasty?</b>

01:52.090 --> 01:54.090
<b>You're exaggerating, Ken-san.</b>

01:54.090 --> 01:57.300
<b>Surely you had tea
while you were wandering about.</b>

01:58.800 --> 02:00.850
<b>As I was away from home, that I was,</b>

02:00.850 --> 02:03.510
<b>I didn't really settle down
to have some tea.</b>

02:03.720 --> 02:06.770
<b>Oh? Care to give us a tale
of your travels every so often?</b>

02:06.770 --> 02:08.980
<b>I wanna hear an unusual story.</b>

02:09.190 --> 02:10.860
<b>Oh, that sounds good.</b>

02:10.860 --> 02:13.230
<b>Then, can you tell us
something that was fun?</b>

02:13.230 --> 02:16.440
<b>I wanna feel good after hearing a story
where you defeated some villains!</b>

02:16.780 --> 02:17.900
<b>Hmm...</b>

02:17.900 --> 02:19.030
<b>Come on, guys.</b>

02:19.280 --> 02:21.160
<b>You're troubling Kenshin.</b>

02:21.160 --> 02:22.740
<b>Don't ask for the impossible.</b>

02:22.740 --> 02:24.700
<b>Let's see, that is...</b>

02:24.950 --> 02:31.040
<b>unusual, fun,
and includes a villain's defeat.</b>

04:05.930 --> 04:09.930
<b>EPISODE 20:
MEIJI SWORDSMAN
ROMANTIC STORY,
ACT ZERO
PART ONE</b>

04:11.640 --> 04:14.770
<b><i>Yokohama's foreigner settlement.</i></b>

04:15.520 --> 04:16.940
<b><i>During the Bakumatsu Era,</i></b>

04:16.940 --> 04:19.980
<b><i>treaties of amity and commerce
were signed with various nations,</i></b>

04:19.980 --> 04:22.190
<b><i>which opened up the port of Yokohama.</i></b>

04:22.780 --> 04:29.080
<b><i>This area was designated as a place
for foreigners to stay and trade.</i></b>

04:30.160 --> 04:31.910
<b>Out of my way! Shoo!</b>

04:32.410 --> 04:33.250
<b>Oro?</b>

04:33.460 --> 04:34.460
<b>I got a rush job!</b>

04:34.460 --> 04:36.920
<b>- Oro? Oro? Oro?
- Shoo! Shoo! Out of my way!</b>

04:38.500 --> 04:40.880
<b>Oh, crap! Are you okay?</b>

04:42.210 --> 04:43.760
<b>What is going on, that is?</b>

04:43.760 --> 04:44.590
<b>Whoa!</b>

04:44.840 --> 04:47.510
<b>That's a relief! I'm glad you were okay!</b>

04:47.510 --> 04:49.560
<b>I really thought I messed up this time!</b>

04:50.140 --> 04:54.690
<b>I see, so I look fine to you,
that I do. That's good.</b>

04:55.190 --> 04:56.940
<b>I'm really sorry.</b>

04:56.940 --> 04:58.900
<b>I'm Dankichi, a rickshaw driver.</b>

04:58.900 --> 05:00.320
<b>And you are...</b>

05:00.770 --> 05:02.150
<b>I am a rurouni.</b>

05:02.740 --> 05:03.740
<b>Ruro—</b>

05:03.740 --> 05:05.990
<b>A swordsman on an aimless journey,
that I am.</b>

05:06.490 --> 05:07.740
<b>Sword...</b>

05:07.740 --> 05:10.200
<b>That means, wait, a samurai?</b>

05:11.120 --> 05:12.580
<b>That's a katana!</b>

05:13.040 --> 05:13.870
<b>Oro?</b>

05:13.870 --> 05:15.620
<b>That's against the Sword Abolishment Act!</b>

05:16.120 --> 05:20.340
<b>Well, this is indeed a katana of sorts,
but actually, it is—</b>

05:20.540 --> 05:22.710
<b>Mr. Driver, over here!</b>

05:22.710 --> 05:25.050
<b>That's right!
I can't just sit around here!</b>

05:25.050 --> 05:25.880
<b>Ororo?</b>

05:28.510 --> 05:30.350
<b>She collapsed in the streets,
that she did?</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:32.520
<b>Hurry! Please take her to the doctor!</b>

05:32.770 --> 05:34.810
<b>"Treatment is a race against time."</b>

05:35.310 --> 05:37.850
<b>So I figured, and I brought to you
on my sweet rickshaw...</b>

05:38.060 --> 05:39.060
<b>Doctor!</b>

05:43.030 --> 05:43.860
<b><i>Suspicious!</i></b>

05:44.610 --> 05:46.280
<b>It's all right!</b>

05:46.280 --> 05:48.320
<b>I am not suspicious!</b>

05:51.580 --> 05:52.950
<b>A Westerner.</b>

05:52.950 --> 05:54.290
<b>And a mask, to boot.</b>

05:54.500 --> 05:58.870
<b>If that isn't suspicious,
Yokohama is an amazing place, that it is.</b>

05:59.330 --> 06:01.250
<b>Misunderstanding!
That's a misunderstanding!</b>

06:01.460 --> 06:04.340
<b>Hey, Dankichi, is this okay?</b>

06:04.340 --> 06:05.170
<b>Huh?</b>

06:05.460 --> 06:08.380
<b>Foreigners aren't uncommon around here,</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:12.100
<b>but can you trust a doctor
that you don't know the face or origin of?</b>

06:12.220 --> 06:13.640
<b>What ya talkin' about?</b>

06:13.640 --> 06:16.730
<b>They say if you live in Edo for
three generations, you're an Edo native,</b>

06:16.730 --> 06:19.690
<b>but if you live in Yokohama
for three days, you're a Yokohama native.</b>

06:19.690 --> 06:20.520
<b>Indeed.</b>

06:20.520 --> 06:21.980
<b>They do say that, but...</b>

06:21.980 --> 06:25.610
<b>Dr. Elder has been in Yokohama
for way longer than three days!</b>

06:25.610 --> 06:28.400
<b>Can't you trust a fellow Yokohama native?</b>

06:28.530 --> 06:33.620
<b>Well, I can trust you,
Dankichi, but a foreigner...</b>

06:33.830 --> 06:35.700
<b>We're all Yokohama natives!</b>

06:35.700 --> 06:37.830
<b>We're at the cutting edge
of enlightenment!</b>

06:37.830 --> 06:39.670
<b>Mommy!</b>

06:40.920 --> 06:44.380
<b>Don't worry! Dr. Elder is
the best doctor in the whole world!</b>

06:44.750 --> 06:47.170
<b>He sides with all the injured and sick!</b>

06:54.180 --> 06:55.510
<b>Mr. Dankichi.</b>

06:55.510 --> 06:56.350
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:56.350 --> 06:58.430
<b>I need to combine medicines.</b>

06:58.640 --> 07:02.100
<b>Please take this person to my hotel room.</b>

07:02.100 --> 07:02.940
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:03.310 --> 07:04.150
<b>Sure thing!</b>

07:04.150 --> 07:06.320
<b>- You're in the way! Get lost!
- Ow.</b>

07:06.730 --> 07:07.650
<b>What the hell are ya—</b>

07:08.610 --> 07:09.780
<b>You're...</b>

07:10.110 --> 07:11.320
<b>Deian Ishizu!</b>

07:11.820 --> 07:15.740
<b>I heard the commotion and came over.
So it's you again...</b>

07:15.950 --> 07:19.210
<b>mysterious wandering Western doctor.</b>

07:19.500 --> 07:22.750
<b>You really trouble me
with your medical treatments</b>

07:22.750 --> 07:25.170
<b>without permission in my territory.</b>

07:25.380 --> 07:26.880
<b>Without your permission?</b>

07:26.880 --> 07:30.260
<b>You only treat Westerners and the rich!</b>

07:30.260 --> 07:31.840
<b>Of course.</b>

07:31.840 --> 07:34.470
<b>Those that don't pay
don't deserve to live.</b>

07:34.680 --> 07:37.520
<b>Then this doesn't trouble you one bit!</b>

07:37.520 --> 07:40.100
<b>Dr. Elder takes care
of those that can't pay!</b>

07:40.230 --> 07:42.560
<b>That's why this is troubling.</b>

07:43.520 --> 07:47.820
<b>Medical care is technology that has
a high price tag on its own to begin with.</b>

07:47.820 --> 07:49.360
<b>The value of Western medicine</b>

07:49.360 --> 07:53.240
<b>that has been imported
in the Meiji era has skyrocketed.</b>

07:53.820 --> 07:58.700
<b>So if I were to leave alone someone
who is dishing it out basically for free,</b>

07:59.040 --> 08:02.410
<b>that drags everyone down,
and the prices are bound to fall.</b>

08:03.710 --> 08:07.840
<b>Don't treat that one dying
on the streets. If you do...</b>

08:07.840 --> 08:10.300
<b>Will you harm me?</b>

08:10.510 --> 08:15.930
<b>Ridiculous. The biggest taboo is striking
a foreigner in their settlement.</b>

08:15.930 --> 08:17.390
<b>Who I will harm...</b>

08:17.640 --> 08:19.390
<b>is the one that collapsed.</b>

08:19.390 --> 08:23.350
<b>If the patient is beyond saving,
there's no way treatment will help!</b>

08:23.350 --> 08:24.560
<b>Mommy!</b>

08:28.400 --> 08:29.900
<b>Both of you, that's enough.</b>

08:30.360 --> 08:33.360
<b>Treatment of this lady here
is first and foremost right now.</b>

08:33.700 --> 08:35.410
<b>Busybodies should stay outta this!</b>

08:35.910 --> 08:39.160
<b>Do you see my gleaming dagger...</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:42.040
<b>K-K-Katana!</b>

08:42.160 --> 08:44.790
<b>What's up with that? It's against
the Sword Abolishment Act!</b>

08:44.790 --> 08:46.130
<b>And you're one to say that?</b>

08:46.540 --> 08:50.380
<b>Pretending to be a samurai here
in Yokohama in the days of Meiji, huh?</b>

08:50.550 --> 08:51.380
<b>He flew.</b>

08:55.760 --> 08:57.680
<b>Stop skittering!</b>

09:01.140 --> 09:03.270
<b>Mr. Rurouni! That was perfect!</b>

09:03.480 --> 09:05.480
<b>Leave the mom and the girl to me!</b>

09:06.560 --> 09:07.560
<b>Damn you!</b>

09:07.560 --> 09:09.360
<b>Mr. Elder! Hurry!</b>

09:11.030 --> 09:11.980
<b>A mask?</b>

09:11.980 --> 09:13.150
<b>Mysterious.</b>

09:13.690 --> 09:15.200
<b>Is he really a doctor?</b>

09:15.200 --> 09:17.410
<b>Better to stay out of this.</b>

09:17.410 --> 09:18.450
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:20.080 --> 09:21.620
<b>A bodyguard, huh?</b>

09:22.370 --> 09:26.710
<b>So I see. If that's the case,
I have a plan of my own!</b>

09:27.500 --> 09:29.590
<b>Track down that guy's lodging.</b>

09:29.590 --> 09:31.210
<b>I'll send him a message.</b>

09:31.210 --> 09:32.090
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

09:37.930 --> 09:40.930
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

09:44.060 --> 09:46.440
<b>I got one more room at this hotel.</b>

09:46.940 --> 09:50.110
<b>It will be best
to rest up until she is better.</b>

09:50.560 --> 09:52.570
<b>Looks like the medicine is working.</b>

09:53.070 --> 09:55.570
<b>Once the fever goes down,
she should be fine.</b>

09:56.070 --> 09:58.110
<b>Foreign doctor, thank you.</b>

09:58.320 --> 10:00.070
<b>You're welcome.</b>

10:01.410 --> 10:03.660
<b>Such a thorough job, that it is.</b>

10:03.660 --> 10:06.410
<b>It was just like this
when I broke my foot, too.</b>

10:06.620 --> 10:08.960
<b>He stubbornly didn't accept any payment,</b>

10:08.960 --> 10:11.750
<b>saying I couldn't make money
with my rickshaw 'til I was better.</b>

10:11.960 --> 10:13.880
<b>On top of that, once I got better,</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:16.050
<b>he's letting me make money
by continued patronage.</b>

10:16.590 --> 10:19.050
<b>He doesn't take money
from those that can't pay.</b>

10:19.050 --> 10:21.350
<b>He willingly treats
those that are in need.</b>

10:21.850 --> 10:23.850
<b>That's just the kind of person he is.</b>

10:24.060 --> 10:26.680
<b>Thank you very much, Mr. Dankichi.</b>

10:26.680 --> 10:27.690
<b>Oh, no, no, no.</b>

10:27.850 --> 10:31.150
<b>I'm the one that should say thanks
for your continued patronage.</b>

10:31.650 --> 10:33.570
<b>Mr. Rurouni, want a lift?</b>

10:33.770 --> 10:36.070
<b>Not taking money
from those that can't pay.</b>

10:36.070 --> 10:37.990
<b>Willingly work for those
that are in need...</b>

10:37.990 --> 10:40.030
<b>Riding without paying
leads straight to the cops.</b>

10:42.450 --> 10:45.200
<b>I am a rurouni,
so I will walk, that I will.</b>

10:45.700 --> 10:48.460
<b>Yeah. That's more like you.</b>

10:48.750 --> 10:52.000
<b>Mr. Rurouni, thank you very much
for your help as well.</b>

10:52.590 --> 10:55.050
<b>How about some tea as thanks?</b>

10:55.050 --> 10:56.510
<b>That is, afternoon tea.</b>

10:56.510 --> 10:57.340
<b>Oro?</b>

10:57.550 --> 10:59.840
<b>You should have some as well,
Mr. Dankichi.</b>

10:59.840 --> 11:03.260
<b>Oh? I don't know what this is about,
but I'll gladly accompany you!</b>

11:05.100 --> 11:08.810
<b>The weather is nice today,
so let's have some tea outside.</b>

11:08.810 --> 11:10.140
<b>Sounds good.</b>

11:10.140 --> 11:12.650
<b>Similar to an open-air tea ceremony,
that is?</b>

11:15.770 --> 11:16.610
<b>Here you go.</b>

11:18.780 --> 11:19.740
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:23.990 --> 11:25.740
<b><i>Samurai sword.</i></b>

11:26.330 --> 11:29.210
<b><i>It was worth coming
all the way to Japan.</i></b>

11:31.960 --> 11:33.710
<b><i>A Western sword?</i></b>

11:41.300 --> 11:43.090
<b>This is a good garden, that it is.</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:45.890
<b>The daphnes are smelling wonderful.</b>

11:45.890 --> 11:47.310
<b>It's almost spring.</b>

11:48.140 --> 11:50.140
<b>Please, have some.</b>

11:50.350 --> 11:54.610
<b>Well, then, in celebration
of meeting Mr. Rurouni, cheers!</b>

11:54.610 --> 11:56.570
<b>A toast with black tea?</b>

11:56.570 --> 11:59.400
<b>Don't worry about
the petty details, Doctor.</b>

12:01.820 --> 12:05.030
<b>Whoa! So this is what Western tea
and pastries are like.</b>

12:05.030 --> 12:07.280
<b>I'll gladly dig in!</b>

12:12.620 --> 12:13.460
<b>Tasty!</b>

12:14.380 --> 12:17.920
<b>Come on, Mr. Rurouni.
It's a waste for you to be holding back.</b>

12:19.420 --> 12:20.970
<b>I will have some, that I will.</b>

12:30.520 --> 12:32.430
<b>See? Doesn't it smell good?</b>

12:34.140 --> 12:36.480
<b>The pastries are sweet and delicious.</b>

12:36.810 --> 12:38.570
<b>What about the black tea?</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:40.940
<b>They use very good tea leaves.</b>

12:41.440 --> 12:44.320
<b>Thank you for offering
something so uncommon.</b>

12:45.530 --> 12:49.830
<b>Perhaps you cannot sense
the scents of the tea?</b>

12:51.410 --> 12:53.040
<b>Actually, not much.</b>

12:53.290 --> 12:54.790
<b>I see.</b>

12:54.790 --> 12:57.250
<b>You seem to be a bit exhausted.</b>

12:57.460 --> 13:00.460
<b>Well, after that big ol' tussle
he had there, yeah!</b>

13:01.050 --> 13:05.180
<b>I don't really feel fatigue
of any sort, that I don't.</b>

13:05.180 --> 13:08.890
<b>There is exhaustion
that is different from physical fatigue.</b>

13:09.720 --> 13:14.020
<b>You can smell flowers,
but you can't smell black tea.</b>

13:14.020 --> 13:16.350
<b>That is a sign of an exhausted mind.</b>

13:17.440 --> 13:18.650
<b>Mind...</b>

13:19.570 --> 13:22.940
<b>Western doctors sure say
really interesting things.</b>

13:24.240 --> 13:27.530
<b>Hey, you're actually
a pretty famous samurai, aren't you?</b>

13:27.780 --> 13:29.700
<b>Well, um...</b>

13:29.700 --> 13:32.870
<b>You must have had a lot of action
back in the Bakumatsu Era!</b>

13:33.080 --> 13:35.120
<b>I know! You're one of those...</b>

13:35.120 --> 13:36.080
<b>Shinsengumi!</b>

13:37.920 --> 13:39.340
<b>Are you all right?</b>

13:40.790 --> 13:43.920
<b>It must have been rough in Kyoto
back in the Bakumatsu Era...</b>

13:43.920 --> 13:45.930
<b>but it was rough in Yokohama, too.</b>

13:46.430 --> 13:50.050
<b>I mean, this foreigner settlement
was suddenly created and all!</b>

13:51.100 --> 13:53.640
<b>It's really become an interesting city.</b>

13:54.140 --> 13:58.100
<b>The level of enlightenment
matches Tokyo and Hakodate, I bet.</b>

13:59.100 --> 14:02.150
<b>I'm sure many interesting
foreign items and creations</b>

14:02.150 --> 14:06.570
<b>from new technology
are here in Yokohama, that there are.</b>

14:06.700 --> 14:09.910
<b>Sure are! This is a really great place!</b>

14:09.910 --> 14:11.240
<b>I love it here!</b>

14:11.490 --> 14:13.910
<b>Actually, I have
a lot of sights to recommend,</b>

14:13.910 --> 14:16.290
<b>so you want to have a tour
on the rickshaw?</b>

14:16.790 --> 14:19.670
<b>Unfortunately, I don't have the funds.</b>

14:19.670 --> 14:21.290
<b>Oh, right.</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:24.460
<b>Then, how about this?</b>

14:24.460 --> 14:26.510
<b>You pull me on the rickshaw.</b>

14:26.760 --> 14:29.470
<b>And I'll give you the lowdown
of all the landmarks.</b>

14:29.470 --> 14:31.600
<b>That way, you don't need
to pay for the rickshaw.</b>

14:31.600 --> 14:33.600
<b>That is an interesting idea!</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:37.520
<b>Dr. Elder, then you
should come around with us!</b>

14:37.730 --> 14:39.230
<b>Oh? Me, too?</b>

14:39.730 --> 14:41.270
<b>The rickshaw only holds one.</b>

14:41.270 --> 14:44.070
<b>You'd have one person left over
if it's the three of us, that is.</b>

14:44.230 --> 14:46.320
<b>Then we'll settle it
with rock-paper-scissors!</b>

14:46.320 --> 14:48.650
<b>The first one to lose
will pull the rickshaw!</b>

14:48.650 --> 14:49.820
<b>The winner rides!</b>

14:50.320 --> 14:52.780
<b>The one in second place
can run alongside the rickshaw.</b>

14:52.990 --> 14:56.120
<b>But then, if you were to lose,
Mr. Dankichi...</b>

14:56.620 --> 14:58.580
<b>Don't worry about the petty details!</b>

15:00.120 --> 15:01.580
<b>Rock, paper, scissors...</b>

15:01.790 --> 15:02.630
<b>go!</b>

15:02.630 --> 15:03.460
<b>Oro?</b>

15:03.670 --> 15:04.920
<b>Tiebreaker.</b>

15:05.050 --> 15:05.960
<b>...go!</b>

15:05.960 --> 15:06.800
<b>Oro?</b>

15:07.130 --> 15:08.050
<b>- ...go!
- Oro?</b>

15:08.220 --> 15:09.050
<b>- ...go!
- Oro?</b>

15:09.180 --> 15:10.680
<b>- ...go! ...go!
- Oro? Oro?</b>

15:10.930 --> 15:12.180
<b>- ...go!
- Oro?</b>

15:12.800 --> 15:14.890
<b>Man, we really do get along!</b>

15:15.260 --> 15:18.600
<b>What are the chances? This is a miracle!</b>

15:18.850 --> 15:20.310
<b>Oro?</b>

15:20.640 --> 15:23.810
<b>But this is going nowhere.</b>

15:23.810 --> 15:24.940
<b>Then we pick straws?</b>

15:25.440 --> 15:27.440
<b>No complaints,
regardless of what you pick!</b>

15:33.070 --> 15:35.080
<b>I will pull the rickshaw!</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:36.950
<b>I am the passenger, that I am.</b>

15:36.950 --> 15:38.910
<b>All right! Then, let's go!</b>

15:48.550 --> 15:52.090
<b><i>Yokohama settlement 39.</i></b>

15:52.090 --> 15:55.640
<b><i>The American missionary Hepburn
made great efforts</i></b>

15:55.640 --> 15:59.270
<b><i>to popularize medicine in Japan
and translate the Bible,</i></b>

15:59.270 --> 16:01.690
<b><i>and this is where he founded
the Hepburn School.</i></b>

16:03.150 --> 16:09.530
<b><i>Back then, the port of Yokohama was
not deep enough for large ships to berth,</i></b>

16:09.530 --> 16:14.410
<b><i>so small ships called barges
transported the goods dockside.</i></b>

16:14.910 --> 16:20.080
<b><i>The dock, curved to serve as breakwater,
was called the Elephant's Nose.</i></b>

16:24.460 --> 16:26.170
<b><i>Yokohama Station.</i></b>

16:26.670 --> 16:29.260
<b><i>The first train in Japan
opened for service</i></b>

16:29.260 --> 16:32.470
<b><i>in the fifth year of Meiji
between Shimbashi and Yokohama,</i></b>

16:32.470 --> 16:34.890
<b><i>symbolizing the enlightenment movement.</i></b>

16:35.550 --> 16:38.850
<b><i>The station building, designed by
American architect R.P. Bridgens,</i></b>

16:38.850 --> 16:43.980
<b><i>was so popular
it was drawn in Ukiyo paintings.</i></b>

16:53.110 --> 16:56.120
<b>How was it? What do you think
after that tour of Yokohama?</b>

16:56.450 --> 16:59.540
<b>It's a good town that lets you
feel the new era, that it is.</b>

16:59.540 --> 17:01.200
<b>- Right, isn't it?
- Oro?</b>

17:01.200 --> 17:02.370
<b>You really do get it!</b>

17:02.370 --> 17:05.040
<b>If you live here for three days,
you're already a Yokohama native!</b>

17:05.040 --> 17:07.960
<b>Why don't you stop being a rurouni
and become a Yokohama native?</b>

17:08.460 --> 17:09.420
<b>Oro?</b>

17:11.710 --> 17:14.130
<b>Well, I'll take my leave now. See ya!</b>

17:18.850 --> 17:20.600
<b>Is it really all right, that is?</b>

17:21.100 --> 17:22.730
<b>It is fine.</b>

17:22.730 --> 17:25.480
<b>It will be difficult
to find some lodging at this hour.</b>

17:30.690 --> 17:31.530
<b>Please.</b>

17:31.980 --> 17:32.820
<b>Thank you.</b>

17:33.860 --> 17:36.950
<b>So you change into room shoes
while inside, that you do.</b>

17:37.950 --> 17:41.410
<b>Mr. Elder, your height seems
to have suddenly gotten shorter.</b>

17:41.410 --> 17:45.960
<b>It's just you. Westerners look small
when there is a ceiling overhead.</b>

17:45.960 --> 17:48.380
<b>Is that how things are, that is?</b>

17:48.380 --> 17:49.840
<b>How strange.</b>

17:49.840 --> 17:51.340
<b>I will change into loungewear.</b>

17:51.460 --> 17:53.260
<b>I will use the bedroom!</b>

18:03.850 --> 18:04.980
<b>Well...</b>

18:08.230 --> 18:10.110
<b>Do you mean Mr. Elder?</b>

18:13.030 --> 18:16.280
<b>So I should just hand this
to him... probably.</b>

18:17.400 --> 18:19.910
<b>Mr. Elder, you have some sort of message.</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:21.910
<b>Oro?</b>

18:30.040 --> 18:32.460
<b>My apologies. You were a lady.</b>

18:32.460 --> 18:36.880
<b>It's just you.
Westerners occasionally switch genders!</b>

18:40.970 --> 18:43.560
<b>I'm sorry. That was a lie.</b>

18:45.520 --> 18:47.180
<b>You have some reason to do this?</b>

18:50.940 --> 18:52.270
<b>I will tell you.</b>

18:52.770 --> 18:54.400
<b>Please, come in.</b>

18:57.650 --> 18:59.280
<b>Dr. Elder...</b>

18:59.780 --> 19:03.660
<b>always hiding his face with a mask,
and his origins are unknown.</b>

19:03.830 --> 19:07.410
<b>But his skills are top-notch.
A wandering doctor.</b>

19:07.410 --> 19:10.500
<b>Sought by notable individuals
and the rich from various nations,</b>

19:10.500 --> 19:12.380
<b>he travels the globe.</b>

19:12.380 --> 19:16.010
<b>On the other hand,
he runs around treating the poor.</b>

19:16.260 --> 19:19.470
<b>And you want to get rid of this Dr. Elder?</b>

19:19.720 --> 19:23.010
<b>Right. This is my territory.</b>

19:23.010 --> 19:26.350
<b>Those that hinder my doings
will become horrifying corpses</b>

19:26.350 --> 19:29.270
<b>that warn others to not follow suit.</b>

19:29.270 --> 19:35.190
<b>However, as I am Japanese, I will not
go unscathed if I killed a Westerner.</b>

19:35.690 --> 19:38.690
<b>I see. That is why you are asking us.</b>

19:38.690 --> 19:40.150
<b>Not just that.</b>

19:40.780 --> 19:46.120
<b>Dr. Elder has a bodyguard that my men
likely won't be able to beat.</b>

19:46.620 --> 19:50.960
<b>A has-been samurai with
a cross-shaped scar on his left cheek.</b>

19:51.290 --> 19:54.000
<b>Oh, that is convenient.</b>

19:54.000 --> 19:58.710
<b>I have a swordsman that has been craving
to fight against a powerful samurai.</b>

20:00.010 --> 20:02.130
<b>I have work for you, Espilar.</b>

20:04.300 --> 20:06.140
<b>A samurai with a cross-shaped scar.</b>

20:06.640 --> 20:08.100
<b>Must be that guy from earlier.</b>

20:09.100 --> 20:15.020
<b>Samurai. That name crossed the seas
and is known across the globe.</b>

20:15.020 --> 20:19.110
<b>Wonderful sword masters
who wield katana blades.</b>

20:19.440 --> 20:23.570
<b>Samurai. They slay blasphemous enemies</b>

20:23.570 --> 20:27.990
<b>and even slice their own guts
to prove their innocence.</b>

20:27.990 --> 20:30.580
<b>A prideful berserker.</b>

20:30.830 --> 20:33.290
<b>I heard they had disappeared
from this world</b>

20:33.290 --> 20:36.210
<b>in the Meiji Revolution 10 years ago.</b>

20:36.500 --> 20:42.510
<b>But I came all the way to this
island nation on very faint hopes...</b>

20:43.340 --> 20:45.640
<b>to fight against a samurai!</b>

20:46.470 --> 20:48.810
<b>The samurai with a cross-shaped scar</b>

20:48.810 --> 20:52.730
<b>seems to have been a famed swordsman
in Kyoto back in the Bakumatsu era.</b>

20:53.020 --> 20:56.520
<b>Hmph. A survivor
of the Bakumatsu Era, huh.</b>

20:56.520 --> 20:58.690
<b>No wonder he's strong.</b>

20:59.570 --> 21:01.940
<b>It is an opponent
you have been wishing for.</b>

21:03.990 --> 21:06.280
<b>A samurai with a cross-shaped scar...</b>

21:07.780 --> 21:11.000
<b>The legendary man
touted as the strongest man...</b>

21:11.870 --> 21:13.830
<b>Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

22:44.920 --> 22:49.930
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MEIJI SWORDSMAN
ROMANTIC STORY,
ACT ZERO
PART TWO</b>

22:45.380 --> 22:49.390
<b><i>Next episode, "Meiji Swordsman
Romantic Story, Act Zero Part Two."</i></b>
